Support Policy
We’re here to help you with Kindred.
For support, email us at sonagydf@gmail.com. Please include a description of the issue, your device model, iOS version, and any relevant screenshots. Do not include passwords, API keys, or other sensitive information.
We aim to respond within 2 business days, Monday through Friday, excluding holidays.
We can assist with:
Account and subscription questions
App setup and troubleshooting
Bug reports and technical issues
Privacy and data requests
General feedback and feature suggestions
Kindred relies on third-party services, including AI model providers. Service availability, model behavior, pricing, and response quality may sometimes be affected by those providers. We’ll do our best to help identify the cause, but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted access to third-party services.
Refunds and subscription management are handled according to the policies of the platform where the purchase was made. For App Store purchases, subscriptions can be managed through your Apple ID settings, and refund requests must be submitted to Apple.
We may update this Support Policy as Kindred evolves.
